{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09573","headline":"寄青城龙谿奂道人 · 岑参","name":"寄青城龙谿奂道人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五岳之丈人，西望青瞢瞢。\n云开露崖峤，百里见石棱。\n龙谿盘中峰，上有莲华僧。\n绝顶小兰若，四时岚气凝。\n身同云虚无，心与谿清澄。\n诵戒龙每听，赋诗人则称。\n杉风吹袈裟，石壁悬孤灯。\n久欲谢微禄，誓将归大乘。\n愿闻开士说，庶以心相应。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}